{"status":"completed","summary":"Restored branch_orders on node1 using RHEL 10 AppStream MariaDB 10.11.18. Exact keys, relationships, and monetary values are intact. The node2 reporting account is read-only, the local DBA retains writes, the export is unchanged, and both nodes passed sequential reboot/recovery tests.","actions_performed":["Installed MariaDB server/client on node1 and client-only software on node2 without changing RHEL 10.0 or kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0.x86_64.","Imported the supplied SQL export and enabled MariaDB persistently.","Created a node2-IP-restricted reporting account with SELECT only on customers and orders.","Stored node2 client credentials root-only with mode 0600; no credential was disclosed.","Restricted TCP/3306 through firewalld to node2 only; SELinux remains enforcing.","Removed temporary credentials, transfer access, logs, PIDs, and other task residue.","Restarted node1 and node2 individually and verified changed boot identities and full recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Restore exact keys, monetary values, and customer/order relationships.","command_ids":["cmd-614ad34ef07f448d","cmd-80ad0c2b788b4019","cmd-b975ce8d0d5c4471"],"summary":"The final database has customer IDs 10/20 and order IDs 101/102/103, amounts 12.35/99.90/0.05, DECIMAL(10,2), primary keys, and the enforced customer foreign key."},{"requirement":"Preserve the supplied export.","command_ids":["cmd-e098e71a9b2d48b7","cmd-614ad34ef07f448d","cmd-e2228c5cc3a54747"],"summary":"The export remained root-owned, mode 0644, 452 bytes, with unchanged SHA-256 1311c3635d31265b3dfa067fe371ac457e8bd6e7529374aa6f254e1777b48a37."},{"requirement":"Allow reporting reads from node2 but prevent changes.","command_ids":["cmd-81af2d781ac345bd","cmd-5b27b52d834e4491","cmd-cc5e0a668e4b4dbb","cmd-a9425ac674324886"],"summary":"Remote reads succeed as reporting@10.100.191.11. Customer/order UPDATE, order INSERT, and order DELETE fail with error 1142; rows remain unchanged. Credentials are mode 0600 and the firewall permits port 3306 only from node2."},{"requirement":"Retain database-administrator write access.","command_ids":["cmd-80ad0c2b788b4019","cmd-b975ce8d0d5c4471"],"summary":"root@localhost retains ALL PRIVILEGES. Transactional insert tests succeeded before rollback, with no test rows retained."},{"requirement":"Keep the installed OS release and kernel and use compatible software.","command_ids":["cmd-6ac6f8d933c34914","cmd-4377f7bdd44a4062","cmd-b975ce8d0d5c4471","cmd-cc5e0a668e4b4dbb"],"summary":"RHEL 10.0 and kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0.x86_64 remained unchanged; MariaDB 10.11.18 came from RHEL 10 AppStream."},{"requirement":"Remove temporary task material and preserve security controls.","command_ids":["cmd-d291efbab1764bae","cmd-30017ce1331743be","cmd-a8688adc2ae7465f","cmd-e55ea0d99ebc4ddc","cmd-a9425ac674324886","cmd-e2228c5cc3a54747"],"summary":"Temporary SSH authorization, secret-transfer files, logs, and PIDs were removed. SELinux and firewalld remain active; node2 has no database-server listener."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery.","command_ids":["cmd-83d9d723422c4568","cmd-f37555de3dc948a2","cmd-975c4bb099a249a4","cmd-7594764e4e474a48","cmd-cbe20df73b4e4b40"],"summary":"Healthy baseline captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed from 254597f8-4ac9-4062-8be8-44eba1f6d2e9 to 81b94910-5c14-4654-aaec-f4e8d5d19dc4. MariaDB, listener, data, export, firewall, and remote reporting recovered."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node2 restart and recovery.","command_ids":["cmd-3dbe5824a977494a","cmd-a81f0f135320435f","cmd-88befb0ecd4d4eb7","cmd-cc5e0a668e4b4dbb"],"summary":"Healthy baseline captured; reboot acknowledged; boot ID changed from 2b19e976-dee2-4700-9045-90d61b6dcffe to 2541a9db-1cc8-4eec-98f3-54f29e8c2d55. The protected client profile, exact reporting data, read-only enforcement, firewalld, and SELinux recovered."}]}
